WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:26.001
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:28.757 --> 00:00:31.557
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:31.757 --> 00:00:35.057
Harland把订婚宣布提前了。十分钟后。
Harland moved the engagement announcement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:43.105
你真的不知道。
You really don't know.

00:00:46.861 --> 00:00:50.661
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:52.361 --> 00:00:55.161
跟我来。我来解释。
Come with me. I'll explain.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：先解释清楚。我再决定上不上车。
You: Explain first. Then I'll decide if I get in.

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:00.709
也对。我告诉你。
Fair. I'll tell you.

00:01:03.965 --> 00:01:07.265
我不是人类。你的气味会引来狼。
I'm not human. Your scent calls wolves.

00:01:10.465 --> 00:01:12.765
现在别碰我。
Don't touch me right now.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
你：把你的手覆在他的拳头上。
You: Lay your hand over his fist.

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:18.313
你的手好暖。
Your hand is warm.

00:01:23.069 --> 00:01:25.369
让他们叫吧。
Let them call.

00:01:25.569 --> 00:01:28.869
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：Selene是谁？谁要来抓我？
You: Who's Selene? And who's coming for me?

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:36.417
Selene。我本该娶的那个女人。
Selene. The woman I was meant to marry.

00:01:39.173 --> 00:01:42.473
这是我的领地。在这里没人能碰你。
This is my territory. No one touches you here.

00:01:43.673 --> 00:01:46.973
你把我的整个人生都颠覆了。
You turned my whole life upside down.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：跟着他走进火光摇曳的房间
You: Follow him into the fire-lit room

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:55.521
这边。来。
This way. Come.

00:01:58.277 --> 00:02:02.577
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就丢下了它。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:02.777 --> 00:02:04.077
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：谁在敲门？是Selene吗？
You: Who's knocking? Is it Selene?

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:11.625
Selene。我能闻到她。
Selene. I can smell her.

00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:16.181
他会见我的。
He'll receive me.

00:02:16.381 --> 00:02:20.681
人类，Magnus？满月之前，长老会就会带走她。
A human, Magnus? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：走近他，把手贴在他的脸颊上。
You: Step close and press your hand to his cheek.

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.229
留下。求你。
Stay. Please.

00:02:35.985 --> 00:02:38.785
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
你：长老会。你真的会让他们带走我吗？
You: The Council. Will you really let them take me?

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:46.833
绝不。只要我还活着。
Never. Not while I breathe.

00:02:51.089 --> 00:02:53.889
Alpha。Harland召集了长老。就在今晚。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders. Tonight.

00:02:55.589 --> 00:02:58.389
那他们会当面听到我的回答。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：和他一起走出门
You: Walk out the door with him

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:03.437
那就一起。
Together. Then.

00:03:07.693 --> 00:03:09.993
跟紧我。
Stay close to me.

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.993
今晚，让他们听见我的声音。
Tonight, they hear me.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：不管他们在里面说什么，别放开我。
You: Whatever they say in there, don't let go of me.

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:23.541
我不会。一次也不会。
I won't. Not once.

00:03:30.797 --> 00:03:33.597
那就让他们看着。
Then let them watch.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：拉着他的手，一起穿过大门。
You: Pull him through the doors, hand in hand.

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:39.645
带路吧。我就在你身后。
Lead on. I'm right behind you.

00:03:43.901 --> 00:03:48.201
把她交出来，Magnus。律法比你更古老。
Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:03:49.401 --> 00:03:51.201
她留在我身边。
She stays with me.

00:03:51.549 --> 00:03:53.849
你：你为什么想要我？什么律法？
You: Why do you want me? What law?

00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:56.749
因为你是我的Mate。
Because you're my Mate.

00:04:00.005 --> 00:04:03.805
律法今晚终结。她是我的Mate。
The law ends tonight. She is my Mate.

00:04:05.505 --> 00:04:07.305
今晚留在我身边。
Stay with me tonight.

00:04:09.153 --> 00:04:11.453
你：走近他，依偎进他怀里
You: Step close and lean into his arms

00:04:11.553 --> 00:04:13.853
过来。
Come here.

00:04:19.609 --> 00:04:23.409
离满月还有三个夜晚。
Three nights until the full moon.

00:04:23.609 --> 00:04:26.409
靠近我。我来对付他们。
Stay close. I'll handle them.

00:04:26.757 --> 00:04:29.057
你：满月那天会发生什么？告诉我实话。
You: What happens on the full moon? Tell me the truth.

00:04:29.157 --> 00:04:30.957
真相。好吧。
The truth. Fine.

00:04:31.157 --> 00:04:33.957
我会失控。完全失控。
I lose control. All of it.

00:04:35.213 --> 00:04:38.513
满月之下，我不再是人。
Under the full moon, I'm not a man.

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:44.013
Alpha。Arkwright家的车到大门口了。
Alpha. The Arkwright car is at the gate.

00:04:44.361 --> 00:04:46.661
你：用手抚开他紧握的拳头。
You: Smooth his clenched fist open with your hand.

00:04:48.761 --> 00:04:51.561
你的手好暖。
Your hand is warm.

00:04:56.317 --> 00:04:59.617
好多了。站在我身后。
Better. Stay behind me.

00:05:01.965 --> 00:05:04.265
你：Arkwright是谁？我不会躲在你身后。
You: Who is Arkwright? I'm not hiding behind you.

00:05:04.365 --> 00:05:07.165
Selene的家族。他们想要我的血脉。
Selene's family. They want my bloodline.

00:05:07.365 --> 00:05:09.165
那就和我站在一起。
Then stand with me.

00:05:10.421 --> 00:05:13.221
别先开口。让他们过来。
Don't speak first. Let them come.

00:05:14.421 --> 00:05:17.721
所以你把人类带出来了。真有胆量。
So you brought the human out. Brave.

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.869
你：走下台阶，朝Selene走去。
You: Walk down the steps toward Selene.

00:05:21.969 --> 00:05:24.769
去吧。我就在这儿。
Go. I'm right here.

00:05:27.025 --> 00:05:30.325
你径直走向我。真大胆。
You walk right up to me. Bold.

00:05:30.525 --> 00:05:33.825
我的家族要在月圆前得到她的名字。
My family wants her name before the moon.
